{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Liu Bei attacked Wu, his army mysteriously vanished. The player takes on the role of a surviving soldier and embarks on an adventure in a mysterious and intricately constructed tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use different weapons to overcome difficulties. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806020/extras/Weapon.gif?t=1750467980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build powerful equipment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806020/extras/forge.png?t=1750467980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learning powerful and specialized skills </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806020/extras/Skill.png?t=1750467980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeking the powerful power of blessings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806020/extras/benediction.gif?t=1750467980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only from a high position can one have a broad perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806020/extras/view.gif?t=1750467980\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The trial version includes the prologue and the first level. More content will be released in the full version.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806020?t=1750467980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets